//   csl-apidev:        og_meta.php                        (copied second, via the
//                      v02/apidev_copy.sh twin lane)
// and is guarded as a true twin by csl-apidev/.github/workflows/twin-drift.yml.
// The scan-viewer repos (csl-westergaard, csl-whitroot, csl-kale) and
// csl-inflect vendor an unguarded byte-identical copy beside the consuming
// page. Do not edit any copy alone - change the canonical file and re-copy.
//
// NOTHING here is hand-authored per page. Titles and descriptions are composed
